  "description": "Original team 'Marketing' from cobusgreyling/grok-bot-templates@4f3f28b4e657 (MIT): lead competitor-watch; bots competitor-watch, content-remix, newsletter-desk. Why: Competitor noise, channel variants, and the weekly issue get mixed until someone diffs, remixes, and still does not publish. Group kickoff (original): @Competitor Watch diff the named set since last snapshot and stay quiet on unchanged pages. @Content Remix turn the accepted brief into DRAFT variants. @Newsletter Desk assemble the next issue unsent. Do not publish. Do not post to Slack or X. Do not send the issue.",
